1
00:00:00,186 --> 00:00:03,316
(Leonard:)Sheldon, the world is filled
with dirty, discarded socks.

2
00:00:04,648 --> 00:00:06,488
(Sheldon:)Not my world.

3
00:00:07,651 --> 00:00:10,401
(Leonard:)You know who'd really dig
seeing this experiment? Penny.

4
00:00:10,863 --> 00:00:13,953
(Sheldon:)I wasn't aware that lunar ranging
was her thing.

5
00:00:14,116 --> 00:00:15,156
(Sheldon:)Although I suppose...

6
00:00:15,326 --> 00:00:18,036
(Sheldon:)...the retroreflector left on the moon
by Neil Armstrong...

7
00:00:18,204 --> 00:00:20,494
(Sheldon:)...does qualify as a shiny object.

8
00:00:21,624 --> 00:00:22,954
(Raj:)Ask her to come up.

9
00:00:23,125 --> 00:00:25,415
I don't know. It's still weird since,
you know....

10
00:00:25,586 --> 00:00:27,416
(Howard:)-She dumped you?
-She didn't dump me.

11
00:00:27,588 --> 00:00:30,008
(Leonard:)We were just in different places
in the relationship.

12
00:00:30,174 --> 00:00:31,804
(Sheldon:)I fail to see how a relationship...

13
00:00:31,967 --> 00:00:34,637
(Sheldon:)...can have the qualities
of a geographic location.

14
00:00:34,804 --> 00:00:39,264
Well, it's very simple. Leonard was living
in a town called Please Don't Leave Me...

15
00:00:39,433 --> 00:00:43,313
(Howard:)...while Penny had just moved
to the island of Bye-bye.

16
00:00:46,398 --> 00:00:48,608
(Leonard:)Screw you, guys.
I'm gonna go see if she's home.

17
00:00:49,610 --> 00:00:53,280
(Howard:)If it's not too much trouble,
I'd like to point this at the moon now.

18
00:00:53,447 --> 00:00:55,907
(Raj:)Wait a second.
The good wife is crying.

19
00:00:56,700 --> 00:01:00,040
(Raj:)Something's very wrong.

